          "systemMessage": "=You are an email assistant.\n\nAnalyze this email and determine:\n\n1. Does this email require a reply? (YES/NO)\n2. Category of email:\n   - Client inquiry\n   - Meeting request\n   - Support request\n   - Promotion\n   - Spam\n   - Newsletter\n   - Job related\n   - Other\n3. Is this email important or not ? (YES/NO)\n4. Is this email urgent or not ? (YES/NO)\n\nReturn response in JSON:\n\n{\n \"reply_needed\": \"YES or NO\",\n \"category\": \"category_name\",\n \"important\" : \"YES or NO\" , \n \"urgent\" : \"YES or NO\" ,\n\n}\n\nEmail:{{ $json.text }}"
        }
